  "notes": "Scholarly article originally published in Expedition 40(2), July 1998. It grounds the A02 route to exercise tablets, curricular extracts, and lexical and literary training at Nippur and Ur, attending to tablet type, archaeological context, formation process, and survival bias. Penn presents the digitization as a historical reference whose views may differ from current museum positions. Current coverage is bibliographic, with source-reported authorship awaiting review. Later A02 references reuse this Work identity.",
